{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56007","headline":"十二时歌 · 文偃","name":"十二时歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"夜半子，愚夫说相似。\n鷄鸣丑，痴人捧龟首。\n平旦寅，晓何人。\n日出卯，韩情枯骨咬。\n食时辰，历历明机是悟（《古尊宿语当》卷十五引作「悮」）真。\n禺中巳，去来南北子。\n日南午，认向途中苦。\n日昳未，夏逢说寒气。\n晡时申，张三李四会言真。\n日入酉，恒机何得守。\n黄昏戌，看见时光谁受屈。\n人定亥，直（一作「真」）得分明沉苦海。\n（见《大正新修大藏经》第四十七册宋僧守坚集《云门匡真禅师广录》卷上。\n此条承王小盾同志告知。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"文偃","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56007.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56007","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}